title Spike 20: T2
about Blue's bot, on a generous economy, grows into T2: an advanced factory, advanced engineers deepening its extractors (more metal from the same spot), then heavy tanks and howitzers. 6x.

scenario economy
economy standard base_metal=30 base_energy=400 tier=2
bot red off
clip 0..10800
speed 6
camera 100,250 95

at 5400 select blue advanced-factory as lab
at 5400 show lab tab 0
at 8100 select blue heavy-tank as heavies
at 8100 show heavies
at 9900 select blue advanced-engineer as deep
at 9900 show deep tab 0

# Observed: the advanced factory goes up about 3 minutes in; by 6 its
# extractors are deep and heavy tanks and howitzers roll out.
at 10800 expect blue advanced-factories >= 1
at 10800 expect blue advanced-engineers >= 1
at 10800 expect blue advanced-extractors >= 3
at 10800 expect blue heavy-tanks >= 2
at 10800 expect blue howitzers >= 2
